WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:01.920
- [Narrator] Are you facing
a challenging dilemma

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:02.917
in your life right now?

00:00:02.917 --> 00:00:04.530
"The Dilemma" is a new Jubilee show

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:06.660
and we're looking for people
who are seeking advice,

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:07.650
willing to be vulnerable

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:09.930
and anonymously sharing
their dilemmas on camera.

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:11.550
Click on the link in the description below

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:12.761
and share your dilemma.

00:00:12.761 --> 00:00:17.761
(gentle serene music)
(transition whooshes)

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:21.930
- I love my girlfriend

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:25.740
but her Christian parents
hate that my family is Muslim.

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:27.390
Should I breakup with her?

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:29.381
Yes or no?

00:00:29.381 --> 00:00:31.710
(gentle funky music)

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:33.540
- [Narrator] We brought
together a group of strangers

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:35.340
to help an anonymous person make one

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:37.350
of their toughest decisions.

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:42.350
- My girlfriend's family
does not like my background.

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:45.060
It's affected my mood.
(gentle funky music continues)

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:50.060
It's affected who I am and it's
affected my ability to love.

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:52.860
- [Narrator] After hearing
the group's advice,

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:54.753
which choice will this person make?

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:59.187
This is "The Dilemma".
(gentle funky music continues)

00:00:59.187 --> 00:01:04.187
(transition whooshes)
(wooden stick clinks)

00:01:07.011 --> 00:01:10.011
(footsteps tapping)

00:01:14.353 --> 00:01:15.420
(transition whooshes)
(transition bleeps)

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:17.820
- How long have you been
with your girlfriend?

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:19.830
- Nine months.

00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:21.980
- What do her parents
have against Muslims?

00:01:23.070 --> 00:01:25.830
- So, we live in a really
tight-knit community.

00:01:25.830 --> 00:01:28.890
Our families know each
other through mutual friends

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:32.430
but back in her family's home country,

00:01:32.430 --> 00:01:34.740
Christians are a minority population,

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:37.200
where Muslims are the majority population

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:40.560
and minorities are not treated the best.

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:42.510
So they have some prejudice

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:44.460
because they didn't grow up in the U.S.

00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:48.720
- Have you had any backlash
on your family's end?

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:53.250
- My mom is okay with me being with her

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:55.683
but she doesn't prefer it.

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:58.953
- Have you tried talking to the parents?

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:04.500
- I've tried to ask her to set
something up and she did ask

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:06.600
but I have not met her family

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:08.880
because they refused to meet me.

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:13.740
One time, I did almost
get to talk to her mom,

00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:16.200
when her mom came to drop her off.

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:17.820
I, like, waved at her
mom but her mom just,

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:18.753
like, walked away.

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:24.000
- Are there any concessions
you're willing to make

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:25.023
to stay with her?

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:30.420
- I'm not sure because I'm Muslim and such

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:33.180
but you know, I'm so young
that I'm really just trying

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:34.590
to figure myself out right now.

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:38.100
So it kinda feels like
an attack on my family

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:39.750
and not necessarily me.

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:41.190
Even if I became Christian,

00:02:41.190 --> 00:02:42.023
I think it's really...

00:02:42.023 --> 00:02:44.249
They just hate my whole family.

00:02:44.249 --> 00:02:45.600
(transition whooshes)

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:48.780
- [Director] Based on the
information that you guys now have

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:52.833
