wanna jump to the yes side?

00:02:55.350 --> 00:02:56.553
- Okay, let it go, bro.

00:03:00.603 --> 00:03:02.040
(gentle brooding music)

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:05.040
- If you can't even be
treated with, like, respect,

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:06.600
like, you've been together almost a year

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:08.130
and nobody's even said, "Hi" to you.

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:10.590
Like, that's not even basic decency.

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:12.000
So I was like, "Oof."

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:13.550
That doesn't really seem like it.

00:03:13.550 --> 00:03:16.297
It might be worth your
time to really invest in-

00:03:16.297 --> 00:03:17.310
(transition whooshes)
(transition bleeps)

00:03:17.310 --> 00:03:21.750
- To what extent does her
family's view of you impact

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:23.970
your relationship from your perspective?

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:25.380
