00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:28.260
that looms over the relationship.

00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:31.740
She's a really timid person.

00:03:31.740 --> 00:03:35.640
So whenever this comes
up, it really shakes her.

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:36.870
Sometimes she cries.

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:40.650
Sometimes we just can't go out anymore.

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:43.740
And it definitely impacts how I feel

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:46.477
because it makes me think, like,

00:03:46.477 --> 00:03:47.760
"Am I doing this for nothing?

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:49.500
Am I gonna dig a deep pit?"

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:51.240
