00:03:51.240 --> 00:03:52.980
and then, like, I'm gonna try to marry her

00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:54.630
and her family's gonna say, "No."

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:58.380
- Has your girlfriend
expressed her priorities

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:00.660
