compromises her relationship

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:06.150
with you or vice versa?

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:11.150
- She believes that over time
our relationship may work out.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:14.760
Like, maybe even into marriage.

00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:18.000
Her family, obviously, is first

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:21.420
but she's willing to make some sacrifices.

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:23.730
She would maybe get kicked out

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:25.730
for a few months or something like that.

00:04:27.090 --> 00:04:30.630
- Are you in love?

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:32.490
- I would say, yeah.

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:34.080
She's like my first girlfriend.

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:36.330
We kinda were friends before.

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:39.120
I think at a certain point,
it kinda clicked for me.

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:41.220
It's just a different feeling

00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:43.561
and it's a different type of care.

00:04:43.561 --> 00:04:46.711
(transition whooshes)

00:04:46.711 --> 00:04:49.711
(footsteps tapping)

00:04:51.552 --> 00:04:53.190
(gentle brooding music)

00:04:53.190 --> 00:04:55.290
- The more questions that were asked,

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:59.670
the more it kinda seemed
a little bit, one sided.

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:01.830
It seemed like, he was
trying a little bit harder

00:05:01.830 --> 00:05:02.700
than she was.

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:05.640
I've been on the girlfriend's
side a little bit,

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:07.260
