00:05:52.320 --> 00:05:54.270
- I actually disagree with that.

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:57.000
I don't feel like you're being controlled.

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:58.410
I come from an immigrant family

00:05:58.410 --> 00:05:59.340
